# WhatsApp CRM

A full-stack WhatsApp CRM system built with the WhatsApp Cloud API.

## Features
- WhatsApp webhook integration
- Lead capture system
- SQLite database
- CRM dashboard
- Conversation tracking
- Lead status management

## Tech Stack
- Node.js
- Express
- SQLite
- React
- Tailwind CSS
- WhatsApp Cloud API

## Project Structure
/client
/server

